    "type": "question",
    "label": "3",
    "prompt": "A jug of orange juice is made up of 100 mL of pure orange juice and 900 mL of water. What is the ratio of pure orange juice to water? Express the ratio in simplest form.",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$1:9$",
      "worked": "Take 1 part to be 100 mL.\n\n100 mL of pure orange juice = 1 part.\n\n900 mL of water = 9 parts.\n\nHence, pure orange juice : water $=1:9$.",
